Source: repmgr
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libcurl4-openssl-dev, libjson-c-dev, flex
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/EnterpriseDB/repmgr

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-repmgr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Replication management tools for PostgreSQL
 repmgr provides tools for managing PostgreSQL replication and failover.
